      "text": [
        "5 - قال: وقال الرضا (عليه السلام) في قول الله عزوجل: (إن أحسنتم أحسنتم لانفسكم وإن أسأتم فلها) (3) رب يغفر لها (4)."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bilal-muhammad": [
          "He said: Al-Rida (as) said, regarding the saying of Allah, “If you do good, you do good for yourselves; and if you do evil, [you do it against] yourself.” <a href=\"/books/quran:17#h7\">[17:7]</a> [There is a] Lord that could forgive it."
        ]
      }
    },
